  "description": "The first wave room. A pendulum you release by hand, with a plumb line and a ring at its rest point so two visits to the centre can be told apart by direction; around it, cubes that follow a prescribed sin(t), a spinning cube, a cube driven by the pendulum's own signal, and a time trace — the integrated swing set beside motions that were only told where to be.",
